  hiredMemo: Steve prevented the Great Shrimp Incident of 2047, which nobody understood.
    He also accidentally erased Dale's cousin from existence. Productivity has collapsed
    because everyone keeps asking Steve about the future. He just says 'buy umbrellas'.
  hirePerformance: -1
  rejectedMemo: 'Steve left a note on your desk: ''Good choice. Or bad choice. I''ll
    let you know in 2049.'''
